# AI Disease Prediction System

## Overview
This project is a Machine Learning-based web application that predicts possible diseases based on user-provided symptoms. It also provides basic health recommendations to help users take preventive care.

## Features
- Predicts disease based on symptoms input
- Uses trained Machine Learning model
- Simple and user-friendly web interface
- Provides basic health recommendations

## Tech Stack
- Python
- Machine Learning
- Flask
- HTML, CSS
- Pandas, Scikit-learn

## How to Run
1. Install required libraries:
   pip install -r requirements.txt

2. Run the application:
   python app.py

3. Open browser and go to:
   http://127.0.0.1:5000/

## Dataset
The model is trained on a structured health symptoms dataset.

## Note
This project is for educational purposes only and not a medical diagnosis tool.